(import :clan/poo/object)
(export DesignReadings)
(def DesignReadings (.o inspections: (list (.o identity: 'spacing-reading view: 'recovery-dispatch-exact-two revision: 'design source-cut: 'sha256-7b2caadcb1c9e77898d8be3998f37897aa687d27b69e93fc07d1da3ee81471bc image-sha: "5d88634b0fe7fbe5b6f5055485d4007d11cfcb09098e4e757755a34457856826" question: 'second-dispatch producer: 'current-model response: "I viewed the revised PNG. Each verified dispatch ID is separate from its source letter, and the measured text rectangles now have clear vertical space. The common frame still establishes the same Attempt, effect and window. Complete sealed ranges and distinct canonical IDs support exactly two. ASCENT closes the count at assessment; the current basis qualifies Temporal admission. The separate v3 sheet preserves its historical basis.")
  (.o identity: 'current-reading view: 'recovery-dispatch-exact-two revision: 'design source-cut: 'sha256-7b2caadcb1c9e77898d8be3998f37897aa687d27b69e93fc07d1da3ee81471bc image-sha: "31fbba89eb692e6473dcb8d18d586ddf24df5817c1ec6970f7440cf4818913d9" question: 'second-dispatch producer: 'current-model response: "I inspected the actual PNG. R42 and R43 are two verified bindings inside the same scope frame; the caption names Attempt, effect and window. The Distinct IDs link and sealed ranges heading make the two event identities and complete count visible. ASCENT closes the count in the middle, while Basis current qualifies Temporal selection of v4 on the right. V3 is still visible on a separate sheet and its basis is kept. The diagram is a selected evidence view; the authority and time verification details are in the design.")) image-evidence: (list
